{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Labor's goal is economic reform and benefits for organized workers."> Arbeitergewerkschaft </span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ labor_strength +] ?], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ labor_dissent +] ?] [? if unions_independent: Unions have defected from our party! ?]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Reformists are pragmatic participants in government, and seek to expand the welfare state and defend democracy."> Reformist / Evolutionary Socialists </span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ reformist_strength +] ?], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ reformist_dissent +] ?] [? if reformists_resign: Reformists have defected from our party! ?]

[? if neorevisionism > 0 : Neorevisionist / Militant Democrats strength: [+ neorevisionist_strength : strength +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ neorevisionist_strength +] ?], dissent: [+ neorevisionist_dissent : dissent +] [? if deterministic_mode == 1: [+ neorevisionist_dissent +] ?] ?] [? if neorevisionism > 0 and neorev_split: Neorevisionists have defected from our party! ?]

